   {
    "q": "WHAT IS AN I-CHING LINE",
    "a": "THE I-CHING IS A CHINESE BOOK.\nBROKEN IS YIN. SOLID IS YANG.\nEACH LINE FITS IN ONE BIT.",
    "show": {
     "diagram": {
      "kind": "line",
      "at": 1
     },
     "hold": 6
    }
   },
   {
    "q": "AND SIX LINES",
    "a": "2 X 2 X 2 X 2 X 2 X 2 = 64.\nSIX BITS IDENTIFY\nONE OF 64 PATTERNS.",
    "show": {
     "diagram": {
      "kind": "tree",
      "at": 1,
      "morph": 7.5
     },
     "hold": 11
    }
   },
   {
    "q": "WHAT DID SHANNON MEASURE",
    "a": "CLAUDE SHANNON, 1948:\nUNCERTAINTY, IN BITS.",
    "show": {
     "diagram": {
      "kind": "bits",
      "v": 42,
      "weights": true
     },
     "hold": 6,
     "portrait": {
      "src": "local/timeline/shannon.jpg"
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "q": "WHEN IS UNCERTAINTY SIX BITS",
    "a": "WHEN ALL 64 PATTERNS\nARE EQUALLY LIKELY.",
    "show": {
     "diagram": {
      "kind": "overview"
     },
     "hold": 4
    }
   },
   {
    "q": "ARE ALL 64 EQUALLY LIKELY",
    "a": "THREE FAIR COINS: YES.\nYARROW STALKS: YES,\nUSING THE STANDARD ODDS.\nEACH LINE CHOSEN INDEPENDENTLY.",
    "show": {
     "diagram": {
      "kind": "odds",
      "at": 1
     },
     "hold": 8
    }
   },
   {
    "q": "DID SHANNON READ THE I-CHING",
    "a": "WE DON'T KNOW.\nTHE LINK HERE IS MATHEMATICAL.",
    "show": {
     "diagram": {
      "kind": "overview"
     },
     "hold": 4
    }
   },
   {
    "q": "WHAT DO SIX BITS TELL ME",
    "a": "WHICH PATTERN YOU HAVE.\nTHE BOOK ASKS HOW TO ACT.\nYOU STILL HAVE TO JUDGE.",
    "show": {
     "diagram": {
      "kind": "overview",
      "v": 42
     },
     "hold": 4
    }
   },
   {
